        "  Agent Balance:    $50.00 TLUSD (UNCHANGED)",
        "  Diagnostic feedback returned to Agent automatically."
      ]
    },
    {
      phase: 6,
      label: "PHASE 6 // AGENT FIXES CODE & RE-EVALUATION SUCCEEDS",
      title: "Agent patches implementation (m2_fixed.py); All 4 tests pass",
      desc: "Agent applies boundary guards. Sandbox passes 4/4 tests in 0.09s. Gemini audits criteria satisfied. Oracle issues Ed25519 signature.",
      vaultBalance: "$50.00",
